    <briefdescription>
<para>Store a configuration of a subset. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class stores a configuration of a <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Subset" kindref="compound">Subset</ref> object. The indices of the corresponding Subset/Assignment objects correspond. That is, the state of the ith particle in a <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Subset" kindref="compound">Subset</ref> is the ith value in the <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Assignment" kindref="compound">Assignment</ref>.</para>
<para>Like <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Subset" kindref="compound">Subset</ref> objects, <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1Assignment" kindref="compound">Assignment</ref> objects cannot be modified and provide a vector/Python list like interface. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
